{"id":"cfa226c1801b4b57b6d55d074aab916e7df970d1","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1252408","title":"订阅了一年多的 Max 号昨晚终于被封了","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"kingddc314","excerpt":"Claude - @kingddc314 - 花了有近两千刀了吧，说封就封，申诉秒失败，天才程序员陨落了！😭","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/封号\"><li></li> 封号</a><a href=\"/tag/损失\"><li></li> 损失</a><a href=\"/tag/程序员\"><li></li> 程序员</a></P><p><span>26 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-10-28 16:21:04 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18228999\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1a00/8067/128584_normal.png?m=1786455968\" alt=\"kingddc314\" data-uid=\"128584\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kingddc314\">kingddc314</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-28 10:16:20 +08:00\">11h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有重新续费，之前信用卡的余额不足暂停了几天订阅，昨晚刚好是新续费的第七天。然后最近 ip 和设备都没有变过，另外最近开始大量使用桌面端，以前都是重度使用 CLI ，不知道有没有可能是桌面端采集信息更多了，反正都是玄学 🐶</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18229034\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4ec912739a17343d727a76cbd1f1435a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"bytelee\" data-uid=\"22423\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/bytelee\">bytelee</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-28 10:21:35 +08:00\">11h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>巧了 一样的重新续费 我是苹果 id 被封了 然后我重新注册了一个 重新订阅 用了没几天就封了 账号也用了一年了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18229064\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2bed/1bbb/597377_normal.png?m=1787206102\" alt=\"xssleak\" data-uid=\"597377\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xssleak\">xssleak</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-28 10:25:04 +08:00\">11h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>可惜你的号被 a 畜拿去做上市的财报了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18229229\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b4a7/dc2e/118929_normal.png?m=1442311108\" alt=\"bytenoob\" data-uid=\"118929\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/bytenoob\">bytenoob</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-28 10:46:24 +08:00\">11h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我都是 vps 跑 cc ，不敢用桌面端</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18229232\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9aa7/008f/372922_normal.png?m=1695809756\" alt=\"iliaoliao\" data-uid=\"372922\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/iliaoliao\">iliaoliao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-28 10:46:27 +08:00\">11h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我第一个号刚注册用了一两个小时就被封了，不信邪马上又用苹果账号注册了一个，同一台电脑一样的网络环境，现在已经用来快一个月了还活着，感觉是要上市了上市完才会封😂</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18229326\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/45270901bcfb32d36d5e42f07bc56c28?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"han1988\" data-uid=\"66131\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/han1988\">han1988</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-28 10:56:26 +08:00\">11h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>要上市了收网了，A/违规收入占 7%的含金量不是说说的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18229466\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1a00/8067/128584_normal.png?m=1786455968\" alt=\"kingddc314\" data-uid=\"128584\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kingddc314\">kingddc314</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-28 11:15:25 +08:00\">10h 51m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>换个号先开了个 Pro ，过几天再上 5x ，这次准备只用 CLI ，再探一次 A÷ 的底线，不行就只有拥抱 Tibo 了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18229686\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/84a6ccf677fb7fdff98ffb39380a6e90?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"br_wang\" data-uid=\"8767\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/br_wang\">br_wang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-28 11:38:58 +08:00\">10h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我上次是用了浏览器插件做一些测试，和 artifacts 产出，就被封了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18229804\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/cd120776ced43c0a02398300781fc2fa?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"LiGG\" data-uid=\"185540\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/LiGG\">LiGG</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-28 12:00:00 +08:00\">10h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我倒是一直用的桌面端，只是我一直开的是 pro ，不敢上 max ，他们说 max 风控更严格。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18230029\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/77d8/7679/286462_normal.png?m=1786276448\" alt=\"jawei\" data-uid=\"286462\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jawei\">jawei</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-28 13:11:32 +08:00\">8h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>我也是昨晚被封的，看起来是跟你一波的。</p><p>苹果礼品卡开的 Max 20x ，用了几个月昨晚被封了。（商店申请退款了）</p><p>另一个谷歌登录的信用卡开的没被封，额度没恢复今天又开了个新号，信用卡订阅继续用。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18230051\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1a00/8067/128584_normal.png?m=1786455968\" alt=\"kingddc314\" data-uid=\"128584\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kingddc314\">kingddc314</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-28 13:19:03 +08:00\">8h 47m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/jawei\">jawei</a> 还能退款很不错了，我用信用卡订阅的，A÷直接表示不给退，正在走万事达申诉看行不行</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18230156\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b24170896eecf7282ebd0fdc2c7230dc?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Grefer\" data-uid=\"533620\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Grefer\">Grefer</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-28 13:43:47 +08:00\">8h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我之前也封了一个 24 年的老号，也是用了 claude desktop ，合理怀疑登录桌面端会采集的信息更多，现在开始都用 API 网关模式了，少一些功能但安全一点。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18230918\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8ca8/4daf/142660_normal.png?m=1786327867\" alt=\"leonleung\" data-uid=\"142660\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/leonleung\">leonleung</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-28 15:45:22 +08:00\">6h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>claude desktop 之前说会通过 stun 获取真实 ip</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18231013\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fcd2/acdd/510273_normal.png?m=1778837539\" alt=\"mindsucker\" data-uid=\"510273\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mindsucker\">mindsucker</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-28 16:01:02 +08:00\">6h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我的昨天封掉的，用了一年多，最近 机场不稳定，我换了个机场，一个小时后就封了，还没申诉</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18231083\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3f82b620ef3f9294ee0946581834bf66?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"godymho\" data-uid=\"84403\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/godymho\">godymho</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-28 16:15:47 +08:00\">5h 51m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有人用过类似 ccrent 这样的服务吗</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18231119\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3c2acd7d4430c57e93f3dd4dc6448a42?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jetsung\" data-uid=\"779164\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jetsung\">jetsung</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-28 16:21:04 +08:00\">5h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                